WEBVTT

00:08.980 --> 00:11.500
So this is the Demon King's castle...

00:11.500 --> 00:13.990
Well, are we all ready?

00:13.990 --> 00:14.950
Yes.

00:15.390 --> 00:19.150
I've researched the powers possessed 
by the Demon King and his subordinates.

00:19.150 --> 00:22.030
Yuga, I know you can win this!

00:22.030 --> 00:22.750
Yes.

00:22.750 --> 00:25.000
We'll all defeat the Demon King together!

00:25.660 --> 00:27.300
I'll do my very best!

00:33.790 --> 00:34.700
Let's do this!

00:38.700 --> 00:40.100
You've come, then.

00:45.970 --> 00:49.940
So you are the heroes who've 
come to slay the Demon King?

00:49.940 --> 00:52.160
Well, I'm sorry to tell you

00:52.160 --> 00:55.350
that unless you defeat me, you 
cannot get to the Demon King.

00:58.770 --> 01:00.930
Such weak magic.

01:01.450 --> 01:04.710
Is this all the hero's party is capable of?

01:10.800 --> 01:12.020
I'll back you up!

01:13.010 --> 01:16.470
Take this! Excalibur!

01:16.730 --> 01:18.470
Endless Dark!

01:28.390 --> 01:30.610
Is this... the end?

01:47.300 --> 01:48.140
Oh, damn...

01:49.560 --> 01:51.020
She's totally my type!

01:55.310 --> 01:57.730
Shall we finish them off, Captain?

01:59.090 --> 02:01.650
Hey! I told you guys to stay hidden!

02:01.650 --> 02:04.360
It got quiet, so we came out.

02:04.360 --> 02:08.740
Captain, you were staring 
at that woman. What's up?

02:09.070 --> 02:09.980
Pervert.

02:09.980 --> 02:13.110
Don't be dumb! I was just 
considering what to do with her!

02:13.110 --> 02:16.380
What do you mean? Shouldn't we kill them?

02:16.380 --> 02:19.860
No. Toss all of them outside.

02:20.300 --> 02:23.170
There's a human village not too far away.

02:23.170 --> 02:24.620
Leave them near there.

02:24.740 --> 02:27.000
You got it.

02:27.500 --> 02:29.000
What a pain.

02:29.510 --> 02:33.090
You're gonna get in trouble again 
if you keep doing stuff like this.

02:33.090 --> 02:34.660
I don't care. Just go.

02:34.660 --> 02:35.930
Fine.

02:36.500 --> 02:39.390
Farewell, my angel!

02:39.800 --> 02:42.800
ONE MONTH LATER

02:41.700 --> 02:42.800
Yoki,

02:42.800 --> 02:47.550
the hero's party has continued to 
challenge you over and over since then,

02:47.550 --> 02:49.560
and they lose every time.

02:49.940 --> 02:51.790
How many times is this now?

02:51.790 --> 02:54.320
Thirteen, Lord Zaekill.

02:55.540 --> 02:57.980
The hero's party is clearly nothing to fear

02:57.980 --> 03:01.070
if they keep losing to the likes of you.

03:06.990 --> 03:08.160
Yoki.

03:08.160 --> 03:11.560
Why do you not kill the heroes?

03:11.870 --> 03:13.110
Demon King...

03:13.470 --> 03:16.670
Weaklings like them are not even worth killing.

03:18.130 --> 03:20.930
If you will not kill them,

03:20.930 --> 03:25.180
I will have your subordinates deal with them.

03:25.300 --> 03:26.280
No!

03:26.710 --> 03:28.810
Those guys are no match for the heroes!

03:29.100 --> 03:30.180
Besides...

03:31.710 --> 03:34.810
No. I will do it, Demon King.

03:40.790 --> 03:43.340
If I let the hero's party live again,

03:43.340 --> 03:45.280
my subordinates will be in danger.

03:46.240 --> 03:48.660
I just happen to be OP,

03:48.660 --> 03:52.710
but the heroes are strong enough 
to defeat the Demon Lord.

03:53.730 --> 03:56.600
And in the midst of all this,

03:56.600 --> 03:59.670
the Demon King is on his way 
to taking over the world.

04:02.510 --> 04:04.380
Next time, I'll finish this.

04:07.820 --> 04:10.280
Today is the day we defeat you!

04:10.280 --> 04:11.470
Let's go, Raven!

04:27.030 --> 04:28.670
Yuga! Swordsman!

04:28.670 --> 04:30.650
I'll heal them! Mikana!

04:31.790 --> 04:33.020
Damn you!

04:45.930 --> 04:48.050
How is he... so strong?

05:00.380 --> 05:02.820
Fight me as many times as you like!
It makes no difference!

05:02.820 --> 05:05.960
Do you want to be plunged into 
the deepest darkness again?!

05:07.300 --> 05:08.780
Cecilia, support!

05:08.780 --> 05:09.570
Right!

05:11.930 --> 05:13.410
Take this!

05:13.410 --> 05:17.420
Holy Sword Excalibur!

05:28.170 --> 05:29.750
Tell me, hero.

05:30.510 --> 05:33.530
You have realized it, have you not?

05:34.310 --> 05:36.770
You cannot defeat me.

05:39.450 --> 05:43.730
So what?! We have to take out the Demon King!

05:44.790 --> 05:45.740
In that case...

05:49.790 --> 05:52.050
Leave the priestess here.

05:52.050 --> 05:55.000
Do that, and I will let the other three pass.

05:56.000 --> 05:58.960
You want to get past me, do you not?

05:58.960 --> 06:00.020
I refuse!

06:00.020 --> 06:01.220
Yuga!

06:01.220 --> 06:02.790
Let's take his deal.

06:03.110 --> 06:05.210
We can't defeat this guy!

06:05.210 --> 06:06.430
But...

06:07.720 --> 06:09.020
I can't!

06:09.020 --> 06:10.450
Think about it!

06:10.450 --> 06:13.880
He's had so many chances to kill us already,

06:13.880 --> 06:15.590
but he hasn't!

06:15.590 --> 06:18.690
That doesn't guarantee we'll 
get out alive this time, too!

06:20.760 --> 06:25.690
Isn't saving the whole world more 
important than just one priestess?

06:28.530 --> 06:29.630
Please, go ahead.

06:35.140 --> 06:37.040
I'll be fine.

06:37.260 --> 06:38.630
Cecilia...

06:41.090 --> 06:44.410
We'll be back as soon as we've 
defeated the Demon King.

06:45.860 --> 06:47.590
Off you go, then.

06:49.170 --> 06:51.180
I swear we'll be back!

06:55.060 --> 06:57.560
Why did you make only me stay behind?

06:57.560 --> 06:58.790
Because...

07:01.160 --> 07:05.280
I doubt my powers can do anything to harm you,

07:05.280 --> 07:07.540
but I will fight until the bitter end!

07:07.540 --> 07:09.450
Holy Laser!

07:09.820 --> 07:11.030
Wait! Time out!

07:15.510 --> 07:17.620
Please, just hear me out.

07:17.620 --> 07:20.900
So, um... my name is Yoki.

07:21.630 --> 07:24.710
What point is there in giving your 
name to one you're going to kill?

07:24.710 --> 07:29.170
I won't! If I wanted to kill you, I 
would've done it the first time we fought.

07:30.350 --> 07:32.680
What is it you want to say?

07:35.770 --> 07:38.060
I fell for you at first sight.

07:38.060 --> 07:40.740
Please go out with me!

07:42.270 --> 07:43.310
Huh?!

07:43.310 --> 07:45.410
What?!

07:48.570 --> 07:50.990
Um... er...

07:52.870 --> 07:53.950
I'm sorry!

07:55.570 --> 07:57.730
I'm done. I should just die.

07:57.730 --> 08:00.830
U-Um... are you all right?

08:01.610 --> 08:04.710
You won't trick me into letting my guard down!

08:04.710 --> 08:06.040
Holy...

08:09.810 --> 08:11.700
Why aren't you fighting back?

08:12.350 --> 08:14.310
You rejected me.

08:14.310 --> 08:15.920
I don't care about anything anymore.

08:15.920 --> 08:17.330
Stop messing with me!

08:17.330 --> 08:18.930
I'm serious.

08:19.460 --> 08:23.440
Even if I live, I'll be 
confined to this room forever.

08:24.050 --> 08:25.640
I'm only permitted to go outside

08:25.640 --> 08:28.940
when it's to attack a human town or village.

08:29.410 --> 08:32.190
But I don't want to do any of that.

08:32.190 --> 08:33.470
You're lying!

08:33.800 --> 08:35.700
All demons are heartless!

08:36.140 --> 08:39.310
The Demon King is even trying 
to wipe out all of humanity!

08:41.350 --> 08:44.020
I may look like a demon,

08:44.020 --> 08:46.340
but I reincarnated here from another world.

08:47.010 --> 08:48.020
Reincarnated?

08:48.020 --> 08:49.580
What does that mean?

08:49.580 --> 08:52.710
I guess you could say I'm human on the inside.

08:53.130 --> 08:55.370
You are... human?

08:55.720 --> 08:58.950
Then why do you serve the Demon King?

08:58.950 --> 09:00.620
As strong as you are...

09:00.620 --> 09:02.600
I could have defeated him.

09:02.970 --> 09:05.490
But if I were to kill the Demon King,

09:05.850 --> 09:09.090
they'd just make me the next Demon King.

09:09.430 --> 09:11.360
I don't want that.

09:12.220 --> 09:15.860
In the end, I'm just stuck in here 
day after day, unable to do anything.

09:16.330 --> 09:18.030
If that's how I'd have to live,

09:18.030 --> 09:20.980
I might as well just let it all end.

09:24.090 --> 09:26.370
But then you showed up.

09:26.980 --> 09:28.360
It was love at first sight.

09:29.390 --> 09:32.650
I know it's only been a month,

09:33.170 --> 09:36.440
but this is the most alive I've 
felt since I became a demon.

09:39.230 --> 09:40.800
And that's good enough.

09:40.800 --> 09:42.560
No, it's not!

09:43.650 --> 09:45.320
You have great power.

09:45.820 --> 09:47.960
If you do have a human heart,

09:47.960 --> 09:50.560
then use that power to help people.

09:52.280 --> 09:54.570
It's not too late.

09:56.050 --> 09:58.570
Come with me to the outside world!

10:05.060 --> 10:08.460
THE KINGDOM OF CLARINESS

10:08.900 --> 10:11.460
Hero Yuga and his companions.

10:11.460 --> 10:13.440
You have defeated the Demon King

10:13.440 --> 10:16.370
who tyrannized our people and 
sought to destroy the world,

10:16.370 --> 10:17.970
and you've returned alive.

10:18.310 --> 10:24.100
In the name of Dartz Olta Clariness, 
king of the Kingdom of Clariness,

10:25.020 --> 10:28.580
in celebration of the return of 
the heroes who ended that war,

10:28.580 --> 10:32.950
I declare the next three days a 
holiday commemorating their victory!

10:35.030 --> 10:36.300
My people!

10:36.820 --> 10:40.360
Celebrate our heroes' great accomplishment 
to your hearts' content!

10:46.250 --> 10:49.400
Looks like I'm almost to the 
capital where Cecilia lives.

10:49.770 --> 10:50.980
Well, then...

10:53.700 --> 10:55.880
Ow!

10:59.350 --> 11:01.390
Heroes!

11:02.890 --> 11:04.100
Welcome home!

11:04.590 --> 11:06.360
Yuga, we did it!

11:06.360 --> 11:10.030
Yeah. But we were only able to save the world...

11:10.600 --> 11:12.500
because of Cecilia!

11:12.500 --> 11:15.270
I'm so glad you're okay!

11:15.270 --> 11:16.610
Y-Yes.

11:25.390 --> 11:27.620
Now, where's reception?

11:29.290 --> 11:31.090
Excuse me.

11:31.090 --> 11:32.120
Yeah?

11:32.120 --> 11:35.260
I'd like to register with 
the adventurers' guild.

11:36.360 --> 11:39.130
Okay, how do we do this again?

11:39.530 --> 11:41.500
Is this guy okay?

11:41.500 --> 11:43.140
Oh, here we go.

11:44.090 --> 11:47.180
Fill this out. I need your name, your age,

11:47.180 --> 11:49.540
and agreement that you assume 
responsibility if you die.

11:50.040 --> 11:51.100
There.

11:52.510 --> 11:55.770
Yoki... age 21, eh?

11:55.770 --> 11:56.880
Okay.

11:56.880 --> 11:59.820
So this is your guild card.

11:59.820 --> 12:04.310
You start at Rank F, and the highest is Rank S.

12:05.210 --> 12:07.580
Complete quests and build up a good record,

12:07.580 --> 12:09.430
and you rise to the next rank.

12:09.430 --> 12:14.330
It'll probably take you about 
a month to get from F to E.

12:14.870 --> 12:16.520
Explanation over.

12:17.840 --> 12:20.600
And don't lose this. It's 
a pain to reissue them.

12:21.080 --> 12:23.340
For these three days, especially.

12:23.340 --> 12:24.510
Three days?

12:24.980 --> 12:29.100
All the other staff took 
time off for the festival.

12:29.580 --> 12:32.390
I don't wanna get stuck dealing with a reissue.

12:32.390 --> 12:34.750
Is there anything this guy 
wouldn't complain about?

12:36.060 --> 12:39.110
I'm Kramen. Good luck.

12:40.900 --> 12:42.860
Great, thanks!

12:44.860 --> 12:47.870
I made a pretty decent amount on the first day.

12:48.290 --> 12:51.180
I gotta raise my rank and get even more money.

12:51.180 --> 12:54.620
And then, once I'm able 
to make a decent living...

12:55.380 --> 12:58.060
I'll confess to Cecilia again.

13:00.130 --> 13:04.630
I'm going to realize this 
love, whatever it takes!

13:15.090 --> 13:16.680
Hey, did you hear?

13:16.680 --> 13:20.460
Rumor has it some guy's been climbing 
the ranks at an insane speed.

13:20.460 --> 13:22.150
What are you talking about?

13:23.330 --> 13:24.820
Heya, Kramen.

13:25.250 --> 13:26.890
I'm accepting these quests.

13:28.180 --> 13:29.940
Why the hell do you always come to me?!

13:29.940 --> 13:32.610
Do you not see that lady standing right there?!

13:32.610 --> 13:35.150
I've just gotten used to coming here.

13:35.150 --> 13:36.620
You get things done pretty quickly.

13:38.380 --> 13:41.090
That aside, just who the hell are you, anyway?

13:42.690 --> 13:45.230
I'm a perfectly ordinary rookie adventurer.

13:45.820 --> 13:47.300
Don't be dumb!

13:47.300 --> 13:53.560
A guy who climbs from Rank F to 
D in one week is not "normal."

13:54.030 --> 13:56.560
Oh, no! Did I try too hard?!

13:58.220 --> 14:02.820
Well, whatever. It doesn't look like you're 
cheating from what I can gather.

14:04.900 --> 14:06.320
For cryin' out loud...

14:06.320 --> 14:08.690
Reception isn't even my job!

14:08.690 --> 14:11.170
Could you cancel that quest, please?

14:11.170 --> 14:11.830
Huh?

14:18.330 --> 14:22.020
Hey, it's the young miss. 
What're you doing here?

14:22.020 --> 14:22.980
Shh!

14:22.980 --> 14:24.210
Oh, whoops.

14:24.210 --> 14:25.380
They know each other?

14:26.100 --> 14:27.690
L-Long time no see.

14:28.690 --> 14:30.520
I need to talk to you.

14:30.950 --> 14:33.470
Please come to my house with me.

14:33.750 --> 14:34.430
Huh?

14:36.920 --> 14:38.950
Your house?!

14:43.400 --> 14:46.250
Lady Cecilia has returned!

14:48.510 --> 14:49.400
Who's that?!

14:53.300 --> 14:54.810
It's so big...

14:54.810 --> 14:56.120
Hey! You!

14:56.970 --> 14:58.170
Who are you?

14:58.660 --> 15:01.230
Why were you riding in an 
Aquaraine family carriage?!

15:01.230 --> 15:02.880
Hey, cut it out!

15:02.880 --> 15:06.260
I'm... not quite sure how to answer that...

15:06.260 --> 15:09.720
What are you doing? This is my friend!

15:09.720 --> 15:11.600
Uh, we're sorry, ma'am.

15:11.600 --> 15:13.710
That's clearly a lie!

15:11.950 --> 15:13.710
Come on! That's enough!

15:13.710 --> 15:15.210
It's not true!

15:15.570 --> 15:17.730
Her friend, huh?

15:19.260 --> 15:20.480
I'm sorry.

15:20.480 --> 15:24.260
I had planned to come and 
see you sooner, but, well...

15:25.250 --> 15:27.090
You don't need to worry about that.

15:27.090 --> 15:29.990
I've been making the most 
of adventurer life myself.

15:30.990 --> 15:33.160
I'm impressed you managed to find me.

15:33.470 --> 15:35.240
There are rumors all over the place

15:35.890 --> 15:40.420
about a rookie adventurer making it 
to Rank D in the blink of an eye.

15:40.420 --> 15:42.230
R-Really?

15:42.230 --> 15:46.500
And I only wish all I needed 
to do was find you...

15:47.620 --> 15:49.130
Is there a problem?

15:50.530 --> 15:51.700
Please...

15:52.340 --> 15:56.140
Would you please leave the adventurers' guild?

15:56.390 --> 15:57.030
What?

15:57.430 --> 16:00.880
I'm sorry to ask this out of nowhere.

16:00.880 --> 16:03.140
Could you tell me why?

16:03.400 --> 16:06.030
Yes. As you know,

16:06.030 --> 16:08.780
the hero defeated the Demon King.

16:08.780 --> 16:11.900
However, this doesn't mean 
the threat is gone for good.

16:11.900 --> 16:16.550
Well, yeah... it doesn't mean the 
demons and monsters will all vanish.

16:16.550 --> 16:18.180
There is that,

16:18.180 --> 16:22.770
but now there may be battles for 
supremacy among human nations, as well.

16:23.230 --> 16:25.860
We've already seen signs of it.

16:25.860 --> 16:26.980
What signs?

16:28.130 --> 16:33.170
Our hero has received many marriage 
offers from other countries.

16:33.450 --> 16:37.130
Well, as good-looking as he is, 
I bet he was always in demand.

16:37.130 --> 16:38.930
It isn't that.

16:39.630 --> 16:44.040
Other nations are using everything they 
can, be it status, money, or marriage,

16:44.040 --> 16:47.440
to amass military might and human resources.

16:47.440 --> 16:51.190
So they want to make him a pawn in some war?

16:51.910 --> 16:57.950
You have been climbing the adventurer 
ranks with abnormal speed.

16:58.390 --> 17:00.000
With your strength,

17:00.000 --> 17:03.260
you're sure to become one of the 
few Rank S adventurers in this country.

17:04.420 --> 17:08.430
But if that happens, other 
countries will notice.

17:08.840 --> 17:10.840
If you were to get scouted

17:10.840 --> 17:13.470
and accidentally make use 
of your demon powers,

17:13.470 --> 17:18.220
you could be used as a tool 
for world conquest, or even...

17:18.220 --> 17:22.010
...regarded as an enemy, so my 
parallel world life would be over.

17:22.930 --> 17:26.410
So I'd like you to stay out 
of the spotlight for a while.

17:26.410 --> 17:29.230
Yeah, but I do have living expenses...

17:29.230 --> 17:34.740
I would be glad to hire you 
and pay you myself,

17:35.050 --> 17:38.310
but I don't have the funds to hire a Rank S.

17:39.260 --> 17:42.930
I will do anything else within my power.

17:43.330 --> 17:45.670
So please! I'm begging you!

17:45.980 --> 17:50.020
For the sake of our nation's peace! Please!

17:54.450 --> 17:56.890
Do not lower your head to me!

17:57.760 --> 18:00.540
You think another nation would scout me?

18:00.540 --> 18:02.010
Utterly ridiculous!

18:02.460 --> 18:06.210
No matter how beautiful the women 
who seek marriage with me may be,

18:06.210 --> 18:07.770
it's out of the question!

18:07.770 --> 18:09.210
Because...

18:10.140 --> 18:14.030
Right now, I only have eyes for you!

18:20.430 --> 18:23.030
Oh, no! My old habit from my past life!

18:23.270 --> 18:27.250
I'm sorry. It seems I was worried for no reason.

18:27.250 --> 18:31.790
All right, then. You can stay 
with the adventurers' guild.

18:31.790 --> 18:35.550
I'll still try to avoid being 
too conspicuous, though.

18:37.400 --> 18:39.800
Cecilia, do you have a moment?

18:40.730 --> 18:42.310
Pleased to meet you.

18:42.310 --> 18:46.300
I am Celia Aquaraine, Cecilia's mother.

18:46.300 --> 18:50.560
I-It's a pleasure to meet you. I'm Yoki.

18:50.560 --> 18:55.020
I'm sorry our guard was
 so rude to you earlier.

18:55.020 --> 18:58.210
Oh, it was nothing worth apologizing over.

18:58.210 --> 19:00.570
I'm relieved to hear you say that.

19:01.300 --> 19:06.190
But do not worry. My head maid here 
will give him a good talking-to.

19:06.190 --> 19:07.530
Won't you, Sophia?

19:07.530 --> 19:09.290
Yes, milady.

19:09.530 --> 19:13.480
I doubt being scolded by a maid 
will change his attitude, though.

19:13.480 --> 19:15.650
How many bones?

19:15.650 --> 19:16.280
Huh?

19:16.710 --> 19:17.550
Bones?!

19:17.550 --> 19:19.150
I leave that to you.

19:19.150 --> 19:20.570
Understood, milady.

19:20.570 --> 19:24.550
M-Mother, is that all 
you wanted to talk about?

19:24.550 --> 19:28.860
Oh, I'm sorry. Allow me to come to the point.

19:28.860 --> 19:31.220
Sophia, you may leave.

19:31.220 --> 19:31.930
Yes, milady.

19:33.810 --> 19:35.430
Pardon me.

19:37.300 --> 19:40.270
Cecilia, did you tell him yet?

19:40.270 --> 19:42.320
Th-There's no need to!

19:42.320 --> 19:43.950
Tell me what?

19:43.950 --> 19:47.780
Well, you see, Cecilia has 
received many marriage offers.

19:47.780 --> 19:48.830
Say what?!

19:49.080 --> 19:51.690
She's even received a proposal from the hero.

19:51.140 --> 19:54.930
You might as well be my wife, Cecilia!

19:51.690 --> 19:52.420
What?!

19:52.420 --> 19:53.740
Mother!

19:53.740 --> 19:57.110
It seems that the hero is quite 
taken with my Cecilia.

19:57.430 --> 19:59.470
What's that hero's deal?!

19:59.470 --> 20:02.090
He's probably got some princess 
trying to woo him already!

20:02.090 --> 20:06.590
If he's so popular, why does he 
need to get in the way of my love?!

20:05.090 --> 20:06.590
Calm down!

20:06.590 --> 20:08.290
Oops! It slipped out!

20:08.290 --> 20:11.850
I turned down all of those 
offers, including the hero's!

20:12.210 --> 20:13.070
Really?!

20:13.070 --> 20:14.340
Yes, really!

20:14.340 --> 20:17.370
And Mother, please stop bringing 
up such things unnecessarily!

20:17.770 --> 20:20.610
So you are in love with 
Cecilia as well, are you?

20:22.230 --> 20:23.700
Figured me out, huh?

20:24.860 --> 20:26.370
In that case...

20:26.370 --> 20:29.550
why don't you marry her?

20:29.550 --> 20:30.370
Wha?

20:30.370 --> 20:31.930
Mother!

20:31.930 --> 20:34.120
Um... what do you...

20:34.370 --> 20:37.380
Just tell me whether you will or won't do it.

20:44.950 --> 20:46.090
I'm sorry.

20:47.140 --> 20:51.640
I've already shared my feelings with 
Cecilia, and she turned me down.

20:51.990 --> 20:56.650
I'm working hard as an adventurer 
now, and once I make a decent living,

20:56.650 --> 21:01.150
I'm planning to ask her again, so... um...

21:01.150 --> 21:02.490
I've heard enough.

21:02.940 --> 21:06.660
So you would reject her 
mother's suggestion, then?

21:06.660 --> 21:09.300
I apologize if I've soured your mood,

21:09.300 --> 21:11.680
but I want to respect her feelin—

21:11.680 --> 21:12.670
You pass.

21:12.670 --> 21:13.290
Huh?

21:15.700 --> 21:19.300
I can't hand my precious daughter 
over so easily, now, can I?

21:19.300 --> 21:21.170
It was a trap?

21:21.690 --> 21:25.680
Well, I can't have unwanted pests 
hanging all over my daughter.

21:25.680 --> 21:30.240
You said your name was Yoki? 
Be a good friend to her.

21:30.240 --> 21:32.430
You are one I am happy to welcome.

21:32.730 --> 21:34.920
Th-Thank you, ma'am!

21:37.350 --> 21:40.440
It seems my mother's taken a liking to you.

21:40.440 --> 21:41.570
That was a "liking"?

21:41.570 --> 21:42.490
Yes!

21:42.490 --> 21:44.190
Well, I guess that's good.

21:44.190 --> 21:46.110
Does it bother you that much?

21:46.110 --> 21:48.040
Well, I mean, that's...

21:48.420 --> 21:50.200
She's your family.

21:54.710 --> 21:57.210
Um, I have a favor to ask.

21:57.210 --> 21:59.460
Yes? What is it?

21:59.460 --> 22:02.710
May I call you "Cecilia"?

22:04.760 --> 22:07.130
S-Sorry! That was a weird thing to ask.

22:07.130 --> 22:08.260
Sure.

22:09.400 --> 22:12.970
Then I will also call you "Yoki."

22:16.740 --> 22:21.980
All right!
